--- Linux kernel UAPI headers (include only) --------------------------------

scripts/remote/uinput-inject.c compiles against kernel UAPI headers
(uinput.h, input.h and friends), distributed in torvalds/linux at master
under GPL-2.0-only WITH Linux-syscall-note. The exception text at
LICENSES/exceptions/Linux-syscall-note states that user programs using
kernel services by normal system calls are not derived work. The injector
includes headers only and links no userspace library beyond libc.

